"critique":"The visual system is strong but has several craft failures. 1) The hero title 'AETHERVEIL' uses a two-tone treatment (white 'AETHER' + gold 'VEIL') that creates a visual seam and inconsistent baseline weight, making the wordmark feel like two separate elements rather than one cohesive title. 2) The 'SUMMON' button's gold gradient is too bright and saturated compared to the muted, atmospheric palette of the rest of the screen, creating a jarring focal point that breaks the mystical mood. 3) The stats bar (Total Power / Spirits / Win Streak) has inconsistent vertical alignment: the labels are top-aligned while the numbers are bottom-aligned, creating a ragged baseline. 4) The 'COMMAND' section header 'CHOOSE A RITE' is left-aligned while the supporting text on the right is right-aligned, creating an unbalanced, asymmetric layout that feels unfinished. 5) The card borders are inconsistent: the 'SUMMON' card has a visible gold border while the 'ROSTER' card has a subtle teal border, but the border thickness and opacity are not matched, breaking the component grammar. 6) The 'Rite Costs 500G' text next to the SUMMON button is too small and low-contrast, making it hard to read and visually disconnected from the button. 7) The hero area's geometric summoning circle is beautiful but its glow is too diffuse and bleeds into the text area, reducing readability of the 'Tear the veil...' paragraph.",
"suggestion":"1) Unify the hero title 'AETHERVEIL' into a single color (either all gold or all white with a subtle gold glow) to create a cohesive wordmark. 2) Reduce the saturation and brightness of the 'SUMMON' button's gold gradient to match the muted, atmospheric palette; consider a more subtle gold with a darker base. 3) Align the stats bar labels and numbers to a consistent baseline (either both top-aligned or both bottom-aligned) to create a clean, professional look. 4) Balance the 'COMMAND' section by either left-aligning the supporting text or centering the entire section to create a more cohesive layout. 5) Standardize the card borders: use the same border thickness, opacity, and color treatment for all cards to maintain component consistency. 6) Increase the size and contrast of the 'Rite Costs 500G' text and position it closer to the button to create a stronger visual connection. 7) Reduce the glow intensity of the summoning circle and add a subtle dark overlay behind the text area to improve readability without sacrificing the mystical atmosphere."
}

